---
title: "pause / unpause (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_caller: validate caller is authorized (Legion operator)
    q_check_caller --> q_check_state: check current pause state
    q_check_state --> q_pause: paused = true
    q_pause --> [*]: emit Paused event
    q_check_state --> q_unpause: paused = false
    q_unpause --> [*]: emit Unpaused event

    q_check_caller --> q_revert: unauthorized
    q_revert --> [*]: revert Unauthorized

    note right of q_pause
        INV-001: pause blocks state-modifying operations (invest, claim, withdraw)
        INV-002: pause does not lock fund access (emergency withdraw still works)
        INV-003: only authorized operators can toggle pause state
    end note
